[11.640803, "o", "gasket hopper layout\r\n====================\r\n\r\ngaskcli/boot.rs dispatches bind, jab, and cork.\r\n\r\nPipeline modules:\r\n- loomkit/  roster writer\r\n- rimcap/   compiled span\r\n- hopmat/   live hop table\r\n- lidpit/   seal writer\r\n- slipread/ card parse\r\n\r\nCards live in /app/buscards.\r\nbind refreshes /app/mistwell/roster.json and /app/loomkit/emit.lst.\r\ncork writes /app/corkbay/seal.json.\r\nFixture copies of the cards sit at /app/cardbak/buscards.\r\n\r\nRebuild the binary with /app/stoke.sh after source edits.\r\n"]
[11.64112, "o", "--- CARDS ---\r\n"]
[11.641222, "o", "### /app/buscards/a_fan.card\r\n"]
[11.642512, "o", "LABEL SET_FAN\r\nWIRE 1\r\nREPLY fan-ok\r\n"]
[11.642807, "o", "### /app/buscards/b_pump.card\r\n"]
[11.643713, "o", "LABEL SET_PUMP\r\nWIRE 2\r\nREPLY pump-ok\r\n"]
